ne in the Dark 3, Sark starts The New Nightmare as Edward Carnby, watches the Shadow Island setup, learns the flashlight-and-darkness combat, searches the forest and manor grounds, reads the first Morton and Abkani material, and works through the early underground and basement passages toward the mansion","startSeconds":17620,"videoId":"pNLUEcGoASs"}],"title":"Shadow Island Arrival & Underground Passages"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_the_new_nightmare_002_morton_manor_edenshaw","segments":[{"endSeconds":25100,"label":"Carnby reaches Morton Manor and begins combing its rooms, portraits, documents and locked mechanisms while Aline radios in discoveries about the Mortons, the stone circle, the seven-statue ritual and the gate","startSeconds":21780,"videoId":"pNLUEcGoASs"},{"endSeconds":23100,"label":"The manor investigation continues through more family records and puzzle rooms; Sark meets Edenshaw, is pointed toward the library, pieces together Richard, Jeremy and Obed Morton's history and keeps pushing toward the library and portrait mechanisms","startSeconds":17344,"videoId":"AdV7Z8kqTrM"}],"title":"Morton Manor & Edenshaw"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_the_new_nightmare_003_library_telescope","segments":[{"endSeconds":20814,"label":"In the next surviving footage Sark is deep in Morton Manor, methodically tearing through the family biographies, birth dates and astronomical clues in the library while trying to understand the telescope, portraits and geometric mechanisms","startSeconds":12027,"videoId":"mjt0WNthHpE"},{"endSeconds":7770,"label":"The library slog finally breaks open: Sark solves the remaining mechanism, mounts and aims the telescope, discovers the 1692 clue, activates the Morton portrait controls and completes the birth-date arrangement that unlocks the route out of the mansion","startSeconds":3766,"videoId":"x1onys2MoYo"}],"title":"Morton Library & Telescope Puzzle"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_the_new_nightmare_004_moors_ritual_fort","segments":[{"endSeconds":8950,"label":"With the manor puzzle solved, Carnby gets back outside and starts the next leg across Shadow Island before Sark pauses for a long break","startSeconds":7770,"videoId":"x1onys2MoYo"},{"endSeconds":19560,"label":"Sark resumes in the open island areas, works out the compass directions and stone-circle ritual, searches the crashed plane, shore and swamp, reunites with Aline, and fights his way toward the fort and chapel route while repeatedly untangling the ritual progression","startSeconds":10470,"videoId":"x1onys2MoYo"}],"title":"Moors Ritual, Crashed Plane & Fort"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_the_new_nightmare_005_secret_laboratory_greenhouse","segments":[{"endSeconds":24000,"label":"The run resumes around Alan Morton's underground complex; Sark gets through the seal door, explores the autopsy laboratory, reads the Lamb, Obed and Jeremy correspondence, opens the route toward the greenhouse and learns that Alan is preparing the gate-opening ritual","startSeconds":20369,"videoId":"XcTFtFrVUX0"},{"endSeconds":25200,"label":"After a short music break, Carnby finishes the greenhouse and laboratory search, obtains Alan Morton's seal, follows the remaining clues and reaches the ancient gate beneath Shadow Island","startSeconds":24120,"videoId":"XcTFtFrVUX0"}],"title":"Secret Laboratory & Greenhouse"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_the_new_nightmare_006_gate_world_of_darkness","segments":[{"endSeconds":28200,"label":"Carnby opens the gate, picks up Jeremy Morton's experimental electric weapon, confronts Alan and Edenshaw around the ritual, crosses the threshold and descends into the World of Darkness as the game abruptly turns into a monster-packed cavern gauntlet","startSeconds":25200,"videoId":"XcTFtFrVUX0"}],"title":"The Gate & World of Darkness"},{"id":"alone_in_the_dark_the_new_nightmare_007_caverns_ending","segments":[{"endSeconds":31960,"label":"Sark pushes through the final caverns, weapons and Abkani machinery, survives the late combat gauntlet and Alan Morton c